###  http://example.org/killweb#MultiEquipmentCommandCapability
# 定义“MultiEquipmentCommandCapability（多法器协同统御能力）”规范能力个体，属于“CommandCapability（统御能力）”类。
:MultiEquipmentCommandCapability rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                          :CommandCapability ;
                                 rdfs:label "多法器协同统御能力"@zh .


###  http://example.org/killweb#MultiTargetEvaluationCapability
# 定义“MultiTargetEvaluationCapability（多目标解析能力）”规范能力个体，属于“EvaluationCapability（解析能力）”类。
:MultiTargetEvaluationCapability rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
