###  http://example.org/killweb#RapidResponseCommandCapability
# 定义“RapidResponseCommandCapability（快速响应能力）”规范能力个体，属于“CommandCapability（统御能力）”类。
:RapidResponseCommandCapability rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
